(6414865, 951378, 114233, '<td valign="top">Its a nice shot but if it doesnt do as well as you expected it may be becasue it looks quite oversaturated. Those oranges are very orange and seem to have lost some detail in the petals. The magenta (in the stems) looks a little odd as well as the cyan in the petals at the back just doesnt seem to fit with the general lighting of this image.</td>', 'Its a nice shot but if it doesnt do as well as you expected it may be becasue it looks quite oversaturated. Those oranges are very orange and seem to have lost some detail in the petals. The magenta (in the stems) looks a little odd as well as the cyan in the petals at the back just doesnt seem to fit with the general lighting of this image.', '2011-05-16 05:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414867, 951774, 101668, '<td valign="top">There is such a fine line when processing sun rays at this hour. Colour on the building is almost over done. AND the sun is not at your back! 5</td>', 'There is such a fine line when processing sun rays at this hour. Colour on the building is almost over done. AND the sun is not at your back! 5', '2011-05-16 05:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
