(6415337, 951765, 40391, '<td valign="top">What appeals most to me here is the wonderful shadows created by the low sun.  Tilting the image so the car is facing uphill I feel is correct to give the image a more comfortable feel even if that means the stone chock is on the wrong side.  On my old laptop the rear quarter of the car appears blown.  I had a look on my mobile (which I feel is better calibrated) it isnt that obvious.  I do like those shadows and I believe that is what you are really trying to portray here.  Well done.</td>', 'What appeals most to me here is the wonderful shadows created by the low sun.  Tilting the image so the car is facing uphill I feel is correct to give the image a more comfortable feel even if that means the stone chock is on the wrong side.  On my old laptop the rear quarter of the car appears blown.  I had a look on my mobile (which I feel is better calibrated) it isnt that obvious.  I do like those shadows and I believe that is what you are really trying to portray here.  Well done.', '2011-05-16 20:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415345, 951620, 40391, '<td valign="top">I feel you may get pinged by a few diehard rules police who believe that to look the other way from a sunset is to look in the opposite direction.  Youre not looking at the sunset so thats enough for me.  I like the silhouetted light on the poles and the colours in the clouds.  The snow on the mountains and the blue in the clouds gives the whole image a nice cool feel.  The front pole with the ropes feels a little too closely cropped at the bottom but that may not have been avoidable.  Overall quite nice  good luck.</td>', 'I feel you may get pinged by a few diehard rules police who believe that to look the other way from a sunset is to look in the opposite direction.  Youre not looking at the sunset so thats enough for me.  I like the silhouetted light on the poles and the colours in the clouds.  The snow on the mountains and the blue in the clouds gives the whole image a nice cool feel.  The front pole with the ropes feels a little too closely cropped at the bottom but that may not have been avoidable.  Overall quite nice  good luck.', '2011-05-16 20:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415351, 951446, 40391, '<td valign="top">I really like the golden colour of the duckling emphasised by the golden hour.  Im assuming youve used a rather wide aperture which resulted in the nose being in more focus than the eye.  If that eye was in better focus I feel this would have made the image much more special.  I do like the smooth water and the ripple effects around the duckling.</td>', 'I really like the golden colour of the duckling emphasised by the golden hour.  Im assuming youve used a rather wide aperture which resulted in the nose being in more focus than the eye.  If that eye was in better focus I feel this would have made the image much more special.  I do like the smooth water and the ripple effects around the duckling.', '2011-05-16 20:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415357, 951796, 40391, '<td valign="top">A nice enough photo but Im struggling to get the feel that its looking away from a low sun with sky being so bright on the horizon.  The few flowers in the foreground do give the image a nice balance.  The bright spot in the sky is a curious thing.  I wonder if this is a real wide angle shot and that is the moon.  If so, this does show that your looking away from the sun.</td>', 'A nice enough photo but Im struggling to get the feel that its looking away from a low sun with sky being so bright on the horizon.  The few flowers in the foreground do give the image a nice balance.  The bright spot in the sky is a curious thing.  I wonder if this is a real wide angle shot and that is the moon.  If so, this does show that your looking away from the sun.', '2011-05-16 20:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415360, 951698, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours captured on the buildings.  I may have opted for a tighter crop as I feel the sky and the areas to the left and right are not adding a lot to this shot.  No doubting this shot as meeting the challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'Lovely colours captured on the buildings.  I may have opted for a tighter crop as I feel the sky and the areas to the left and right are not adding a lot to this shot.  No doubting this shot as meeting the challenge.  Good luck.', '2011-05-16 20:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415365, 951802, 40391, '<td valign="top">An excellent capture of a Great Blue Heron (I had to look that acronym up as all I could think of was Grievous Bodily Harm :-)  ).  There is nothing here for me to say un-categorically that this meets the challenge but I will take your work for it.  The focus and exposure is perfect and I really like the pose.  Well done.</td>', 'An excellent capture of a Great Blue Heron (I had to look that acronym up as all I could think of was Grievous Bodily Harm :-)  ).  There is nothing here for me to say un-categorically that this meets the challenge but I will take your work for it.  The focus and exposure is perfect and I really like the pose.  Well done.', '2011-05-16 20:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415368, 951558, 40391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrasting colours between the sunlight in the trees and the frost on the ground.  The mist is just gorgeous.  As this is advanced editing I would have spent the time cloning out the power line as this image is worth it.  Well done and good luck.</td>', 'Beautiful contrasting colours between the sunlight in the trees and the frost on the ground.  The mist is just gorgeous.  As this is advanced editing I would have spent the time cloning out the power line as this image is worth it.  Well done and good luck.', '2011-05-16 20:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415373, 951799, 40391, '<td valign="top">I really like the different bands of colours you have captured here.  I feel a tighter crop stopping at the pink of the hills may have made this even better for me.  Good luck.</td>', 'I really like the different bands of colours you have captured here.  I feel a tighter crop stopping at the pink of the hills may have made this even better for me.  Good luck.', '2011-05-16 20:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415382, 951776, 40391, '<td valign="top">A lovely portrait and great use of DoF with the dress.  Theres nothing here that really helps me feel this was taken with the challenge in mind but it is still very pleasing to look at and that smile is wonderful.</td>', 'A lovely portrait and great use of DoF with the dress.  Theres nothing here that really helps me feel this was taken with the challenge in mind but it is still very pleasing to look at and that smile is wonderful.', '2011-05-16 20:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415384, 951795, 40391, '<td valign="top">The light on the hills and the moon shows a definite photo meeting the challenge.  The palm in the foreground and moon in the distance provides a nice composition but there is not a lot to really grab your attention.  I do appreciate the effort taken to take a shot for the challenge and making the most of what youve got to shoot.  Good luck.</td>', 'The light on the hills and the moon shows a definite photo meeting the challenge.  The palm in the foreground and moon in the distance provides a nice composition but there is not a lot to really grab your attention.  I do appreciate the effort taken to take a shot for the challenge and making the most of what youve got to shoot.  Good luck.', '2011-05-16 21:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415385, 951722, 554, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Absolutely shows the other way.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Absolutely shows the other way.', '2011-05-16 21:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415392, 951623, 40391, '<td valign="top">The colours on her face is just lovely (got to love the golden hour for portraits).  The DoF is perfect to show details over all her face but to subdue the background.  The background still adds a lot this image with supporting and complementary colours.  It would have been nice not to have that object in the bottom right but too much of the composition would have been lost if it was cropped out.  Her smile and eyes is telling a story that wants me to know what it was that she just heard or saw.<br/> <br/>Now I know Im probably wrong here as Ive seen in the thumbnails of a cowboy with a big moustache in B&amp;W but Im going to have a guess that this is  <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yo_Spiff</a> as I see his processing and style in this image.  If not, please accept this as a compliment as I do enjoy his work.</td>', 'The colours on her face is just lovely (got to love the golden hour for portraits).  The DoF is perfect to show details over all her face but to subdue the background.  The background still adds a lot this image with supporting and complementary colours.  It would have been nice not to have that object in the bottom right but too much of the composition would have been lost if it was cropped out.  Her smile and eyes is telling a story that wants me to know what it was that she just heard or saw. Now I know Im probably wrong here as Ive seen in the thumbnails of a cowboy with a big moustache in B&W but Im going to have a guess that this is   Yo_Spiff as I see his processing and style in this image.  If not, please accept this as a compliment as I do enjoy his work.', '2011-05-16 21:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415396, 951352, 40391, '<td valign="top">I love the soft colours and the sharp contrast of the surfers in this image.  Its a great location and wonder capture of a moment in time.  Well done.</td>', 'I love the soft colours and the sharp contrast of the surfers in this image.  Its a great location and wonder capture of a moment in time.  Well done.', '2011-05-16 21:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415397, 951587, 40391, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of the soft natural light.  Lovely bokeh as well.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice use of the soft natural light.  Lovely bokeh as well.  Well done.', '2011-05-16 21:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415405, 951777, 40391, '<td valign="top">Ive seen several shots with the moon in this challenge but this is a take of the word with much more interest (for me).  Very nice composition and use of light.  I like her expression but not too sure about her eye which is the only thing that bothers me in this image.  For me this is definitely in the style of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=5885" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">fotomann_forever</a> but Im not too sure it is his work.  Good luck.</td>', 'Ive seen several shots with the moon in this challenge but this is a take of the word with much more interest (for me).  Very nice composition and use of light.  I like her expression but not too sure about her eye which is the only thing that bothers me in this image.  For me this is definitely in the style of  fotomann_forever but Im not too sure it is his work.  Good luck.', '2011-05-16 21:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415410, 951792, 40391, '<td valign="top">A wonderfully composed architectural shot.  I really like the golden colours captured with the complimentary shades of blue.  Well done!</td>', 'A wonderfully composed architectural shot.  I really like the golden colours captured with the complimentary shades of blue.  Well done!', '2011-05-16 21:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415412, 951610, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely light captured on a very interesting building.  I wonder if you may have been able to bring out more colours during post processing to add even more impact to the image.  Good luck.</td>', 'Lovely light captured on a very interesting building.  I wonder if you may have been able to bring out more colours during post processing to add even more impact to the image.  Good luck.', '2011-05-16 21:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415414, 951206, 40391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of the soft natural light.  The colours are wonderful.  I feel the focal point is just a little off as I feel it needed to be on the centre object of the flower but overall a lovely image.  Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful use of the soft natural light.  The colours are wonderful.  I feel the focal point is just a little off as I feel it needed to be on the centre object of the flower but overall a lovely image.  Well done.', '2011-05-16 21:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415417, 951630, 40391, '<td valign="top">What an interesting location and good use of the low sunlight.  I like what the leafless tree adds to this image.  The composition of the model seems a little off for me.  Perhaps if she was looking straight ahead and her left hand was a little lower on the statue... ;-)  Good luck.</td>', 'What an interesting location and good use of the low sunlight.  I like what the leafless tree adds to this image.  The composition of the model seems a little off for me.  Perhaps if she was looking straight ahead and her left hand was a little lower on the statue... ;-)  Good luck.', '2011-05-16 21:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415419, 951770, 40391, '<td valign="top">Youve produced some lovely contrasting and complimenting colours here.  Quite nicely composed too.  Well done.</td>', 'Youve produced some lovely contrasting and complimenting colours here.  Quite nicely composed too.  Well done.', '2011-05-16 21:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415422, 951641, 40391, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing with the B737 crossing the moon.  The clouds add a nice interest to the image as well.  But its the perfect exposure of the moon that really makes this shot for me as its something I have not been able to achieve and when it is wrong can look terrible.  Well done and good luck  this should do well.</td>', 'Perfect timing with the B737 crossing the moon.  The clouds add a nice interest to the image as well.  But its the perfect exposure of the moon that really makes this shot for me as its something I have not been able to achieve and when it is wrong can look terrible.  Well done and good luck  this should do well.', '2011-05-16 21:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415428, 951589, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is truly a wonder image that really appeals to me.  I love the contrasting light, composition, perspective and colours captured.  One of my preferred images of the challenge.  Well done!</td>', 'This is truly a wonder image that really appeals to me.  I love the contrasting light, composition, perspective and colours captured.  One of my preferred images of the challenge.  Well done!', '2011-05-16 21:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415431, 951719, 40391, '<td valign="top">An excellent shot that captures the intent of the challenge wonderfully.  I also love the added drama added by the clouds.  This should do well in the challenge  Good luck.</td>', 'An excellent shot that captures the intent of the challenge wonderfully.  I also love the added drama added by the clouds.  This should do well in the challenge  Good luck.', '2011-05-16 22:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415432, 951407, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice find and lovely colours.  It must be an optical illusion but the engraving almost looks raised.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice find and lovely colours.  It must be an optical illusion but the engraving almost looks raised.  Good luck.', '2011-05-16 22:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415433, 950938, 40391, '<td valign="top">Great use of the natural light and very nicely composed with the shallow DoF.  Would have been nice to have had the full reflection of the front duck but its still a very nice image though.</td>', 'Great use of the natural light and very nicely composed with the shallow DoF.  Would have been nice to have had the full reflection of the front duck but its still a very nice image though.', '2011-05-16 22:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415437, 951725, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the light and reflection.  Such and interesting building.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice capture of the light and reflection.  Such and interesting building.  Well done.', '2011-05-16 22:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415440, 951587, 91783, '<td valign="top">This has really nice even light!! really good job with clearity and sharpness :) good luck!</td>', 'This has really nice even light!! really good job with clearity and sharpness :) good luck!', '2011-05-16 22:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415442, 951718, 91783, '<td valign="top">ahhhhh!!! it could have been such a great picture!!! I think that the subject is great, nice pose, really good light. i think that this photo just needs to focus. just be aware of where the focus points are and making sure that what you want, hopefully the face (especially the eyes) is in focus.</td>', 'ahhhhh!!! it could have been such a great picture!!! I think that the subject is great, nice pose, really good light. i think that this photo just needs to focus. just be aware of where the focus points are and making sure that what you want, hopefully the face (especially the eyes) is in focus.', '2011-05-16 22:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415443, 951166, 91783, '<td valign="top">i think that this photo needs a little more contrast, that way the trees and barn would pop more. just imo... great photo other wise.</td>', 'i think that this photo needs a little more contrast, that way the trees and barn would pop more. just imo... great photo other wise.', '2011-05-16 22:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415444, 951763, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours captured here and the DoF is perfect  very nice!</td>', 'Lovely colours captured here and the DoF is perfect  very nice!', '2011-05-16 22:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415445, 951750, 40391, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and I love the reflections captured in the glasses.  I quite like your title too.</td>', 'Interesting perspective and I love the reflections captured in the glasses.  I quite like your title too.', '2011-05-16 22:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415446, 951370, 40391, '<td valign="top">I really like the excessive graininess of this image as well as the composition.  Might of done well in the fences challenge as well.  Well done!</td>', 'I really like the excessive graininess of this image as well as the composition.  Might of done well in the fences challenge as well.  Well done!', '2011-05-16 22:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415449, 951751, 40391, '<td valign="top">Even though theres not really a lot happening here the lighting effect is quite nice to look at.  Good luck.</td>', 'Even though theres not really a lot happening here the lighting effect is quite nice to look at.  Good luck.', '2011-05-16 22:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
