(6415453, 951452, 40391, '<td valign="top">There are great colours in those buildings.  I like the framing of the image with the fauna.  I wasnt too sure about the carpark adding to the image but I do like the shadows reaching across it.  Good luck.</td>', 'There are great colours in those buildings.  I like the framing of the image with the fauna.  I wasnt too sure about the carpark adding to the image but I do like the shadows reaching across it.  Good luck.', '2011-05-16 22:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
