(6415459, 951505, 40391, '<td valign="top">Perfect amount of exposure to create such drama and beauty in that river.  The colours captured in the sky adds much to the image as well.  Well done!</td>', 'Perfect amount of exposure to create such drama and beauty in that river.  The colours captured in the sky adds much to the image as well.  Well done!', '2011-05-16 22:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
