(6415461, 951718, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely smile and nice bokeh.  I feel the focus could be a bit sharper and its a little hard to tell if it really meets the challenge especially with the bright areas behind her.  Good luck.</td>', 'Lovely smile and nice bokeh.  I feel the focus could be a bit sharper and its a little hard to tell if it really meets the challenge especially with the bright areas behind her.  Good luck.', '2011-05-16 22:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415462, 951477, 40391, '<td valign="top">I just love the drama you have captured with this image.  Well done!</td>', 'I just love the drama you have captured with this image.  Well done!', '2011-05-16 22:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415463, 951352, 112156, '<td valign="top">very nice indeed</td>', 'very nice indeed', '2011-05-16 22:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415465, 951378, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours captured here with the low natural light.  Good luck.</td>', 'Lovely colours captured here with the low natural light.  Good luck.', '2011-05-16 22:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415466, 951656, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is such a beautiful image with lovely colours and great composition.  I really like the reflection.  This should do well and may even ribbon.  Well done and good luck!</td>', 'This is such a beautiful image with lovely colours and great composition.  I really like the reflection.  This should do well and may even ribbon.  Well done and good luck!', '2011-05-16 22:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415469, 951780, 40391, '<td valign="top">There is just so much to like about this image.  I like the way youve added the lamp in the background.  The colours, lighting, shadows and reflection of the glass in the shadows are lovely.  One of my preferred shots for the challenge.  Well done!</td>', 'There is just so much to like about this image.  I like the way youve added the lamp in the background.  The colours, lighting, shadows and reflection of the glass in the shadows are lovely.  One of my preferred shots for the challenge.  Well done!', '2011-05-16 22:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415471, 951779, 40391, '<td valign="top">Now thats an interesting find in a great location nicely captured with the low sun.  The HDR effect has brought out nicely the details and colours from the shadows.  An excellent deep DoF has been achieved as well.  Well done!</td>', 'Now thats an interesting find in a great location nicely captured with the low sun.  The HDR effect has brought out nicely the details and colours from the shadows.  An excellent deep DoF has been achieved as well.  Well done!', '2011-05-16 22:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415472, 951139, 40391, '<td valign="top">A nice story and nicely composed.  Good luck.</td>', 'A nice story and nicely composed.  Good luck.', '2011-05-16 22:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415474, 951269, 40391, '<td valign="top">A quite interesting perspective with wonderful lighting.  Good luck.</td>', 'A quite interesting perspective with wonderful lighting.  Good luck.', '2011-05-16 22:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415504, 951276, 40391, '<td valign="top">I feel you may get pinged by a few diehard rules police who believe that to look the other way from a sunset is to look in the opposite direction.  Youre not looking at the sunset so thats enough for me.  Lovely colours and effect from the long exposure.  I particularly like the colours in the sky and the drama from the falling rain.  Good luck.</td>', 'I feel you may get pinged by a few diehard rules police who believe that to look the other way from a sunset is to look in the opposite direction.  Youre not looking at the sunset so thats enough for me.  Lovely colours and effect from the long exposure.  I particularly like the colours in the sky and the drama from the falling rain.  Good luck.', '2011-05-17 00:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415508, 951613, 40391, '<td valign="top">I really like the reflections in the window.  Nice find.</td>', 'I really like the reflections in the window.  Nice find.', '2011-05-17 00:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415510, 951721, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the fading natural light.  The bokeh is interesting and adds a nice contrast.</td>', 'Nice capture of the fading natural light.  The bokeh is interesting and adds a nice contrast.', '2011-05-17 00:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415512, 951420, 40391, '<td valign="top">An interesting and powerful landscape image that is nicely contrasted against the sky.</td>', 'An interesting and powerful landscape image that is nicely contrasted against the sky.', '2011-05-17 00:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415515, 951774, 40391, '<td valign="top">Interesting colours from an even more interesting building.  It feels a little over saturated for my taste but it definitely catches the eye.</td>', 'Interesting colours from an even more interesting building.  It feels a little over saturated for my taste but it definitely catches the eye.', '2011-05-17 00:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415517, 951633, 40391, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured and processed.  I love the colours as well as the reflections.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nicely captured and processed.  I love the colours as well as the reflections.  Well done!', '2011-05-17 00:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415521, 951705, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours but I feel its a tad over saturated.  The slight lean of the buildings is a bit distracting but it was a nice find.  Good luck.</td>', 'Lovely colours but I feel its a tad over saturated.  The slight lean of the buildings is a bit distracting but it was a nice find.  Good luck.', '2011-05-17 00:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415522, 951494, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice find and lovely colours.  I really like the way you have composed this image and the square crop adds nicely to it.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice find and lovely colours.  I really like the way you have composed this image and the square crop adds nicely to it.  Well done!', '2011-05-17 00:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415526, 951597, 40391, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful, crisp and clear image.  This is post card material and should do well in the challenge.  Well done and good luck!</td>', 'What a beautiful, crisp and clear image.  This is post card material and should do well in the challenge.  Well done and good luck!', '2011-05-17 00:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415527, 951711, 40391, '<td valign="top">Great capture in the glass of the sunset.  The people add a nice interest to the photo.</td>', 'Great capture in the glass of the sunset.  The people add a nice interest to the photo.', '2011-05-17 00:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415529, 951403, 40391, '<td valign="top">A beautiful location!   I like the touch of pink in the clouds but its having the person in the composition that makes it an interesting as well as appealing image.  Well done.</td>', 'A beautiful location!   I like the touch of pink in the clouds but its having the person in the composition that makes it an interesting as well as appealing image.  Well done.', '2011-05-17 00:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415530, 951106, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured sunset and the colours on the wood are appealing.  Im not sure about the narrowness of the crop.  Perhaps adding a thickish boarder to the top and bottom may have helped a bit.  The slight tilt is a little distracting too.</td>', 'Nicely captured sunset and the colours on the wood are appealing.  Im not sure about the narrowness of the crop.  Perhaps adding a thickish boarder to the top and bottom may have helped a bit.  The slight tilt is a little distracting too.', '2011-05-17 00:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415532, 951768, 40391, '<td valign="top">Great use of that lovely golden hour light.  Im really liking the story this image is telling me.  The suitcase is a nice touch.  Well done and good luck.</td>', 'Great use of that lovely golden hour light.  Im really liking the story this image is telling me.  The suitcase is a nice touch.  Well done and good luck.', '2011-05-17 01:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415537, 951621, 40391, '<td valign="top">To find something interesting to photo all you have to do sometimes is to just look down.  I quite like the pose of the flower and the way its contrasted against the background.  However, I see some slight processing artefacts around the flower and leaves.  Perhaps the background has been blurred in processing to increase the pop of the flower.  Even though I do find it a little distracting it doesnt take that much away from my overall appreciation of the image.  Good luck.</td>', 'To find something interesting to photo all you have to do sometimes is to just look down.  I quite like the pose of the flower and the way its contrasted against the background.  However, I see some slight processing artefacts around the flower and leaves.  Perhaps the background has been blurred in processing to increase the pop of the flower.  Even though I do find it a little distracting it doesnt take that much away from my overall appreciation of the image.  Good luck.', '2011-05-17 01:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415539, 951798, 40391, '<td valign="top">An interesting landscape and I do like the blues in the sky.  However, for this shot I feel the moon and clouds should have been more focused than the foreground as they are more what the image is about.</td>', 'An interesting landscape and I do like the blues in the sky.  However, for this shot I feel the moon and clouds should have been more focused than the foreground as they are more what the image is about.', '2011-05-17 01:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415549, 951709, 40391, '<td valign="top">I love the reflection of the buildings being hit with the setting sun.  The overall composition is very interesting.  Nice find and capture.</td>', 'I love the reflection of the buildings being hit with the setting sun.  The overall composition is very interesting.  Nice find and capture.', '2011-05-17 01:19:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6415550, 951166, 40391, '<td valign="top">A great find nicely captured.  The mountains in the background are impressive too.</td>', 'A great find nicely captured.  The mountains in the background are impressive too.', '2011-05-17 01:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415553, 951801, 40391, '<td valign="top">I almost had this pegged as a  <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yo_Spiff</a> shot but another image made me think that this was not quite his style but one of his choice of models.  So Im guessing this is someone close to him and is possibly <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=116574" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">cowtownmom</a>.<br/> <br/>This is a great portrait that is nicely framed.  Youve done well to capture his character and happy emotion.  A couple of things I found slightly distracting is that the focus is slightly off for his eyes and the side of his face is a little blown.  But this doesnt take much away from character you have captured.  Well done.</td>', 'I almost had this pegged as a   Yo_Spiff shot but another image made me think that this was not quite his style but one of his choice of models.  So Im guessing this is someone close to him and is possibly  cowtownmom. This is a great portrait that is nicely framed.  Youve done well to capture his character and happy emotion.  A couple of things I found slightly distracting is that the focus is slightly off for his eyes and the side of his face is a little blown.  But this doesnt take much away from character you have captured.  Well done.', '2011-05-17 01:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415563, 950938, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is just lovely. I love the swirling greens, but mostly of course the lighting on that duckling.8</td>', 'This is just lovely. I love the swirling greens, but mostly of course the lighting on that duckling.8', '2011-05-17 01:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415566, 951403, 115307, '<td valign="top">I think I might have liked this a bit better without the person. Or maybe just with a different more meaningful pose. Still a lovely scene and landscape 7</td>', 'I think I might have liked this a bit better without the person. Or maybe just with a different more meaningful pose. Still a lovely scene and landscape 7', '2011-05-17 01:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415568, 951352, 115307, '<td valign="top">Man, this is just gorgeous. I love the pastel skies and the surfers and water are just amazing. Wish the guy on the left wasn''t there, but he''ll do. The rest of the photo far outweighs him. 9</td>', 'Man, this is just gorgeous. I love the pastel skies and the surfers and water are just amazing. Wish the guy on the left wasn''t there, but he''ll do. The rest of the photo far outweighs him. 9', '2011-05-17 01:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415584, 951597, 86090, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! this is gorgeous, I love those rich colors!</td>', 'Wow!!! this is gorgeous, I love those rich colors!', '2011-05-17 02:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415585, 951767, 86090, '<td valign="top">Very soft and dreamy, so beautiful!</td>', 'Very soft and dreamy, so beautiful!', '2011-05-17 02:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415586, 951725, 86090, '<td valign="top">Majestic indeed!, wonderful work capturing its beauty</td>', 'Majestic indeed!, wonderful work capturing its beauty', '2011-05-17 02:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415587, 951352, 86090, '<td valign="top">I really like this... very much!</td>', 'I really like this... very much!', '2011-05-17 02:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415589, 951768, 86090, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2011-05-17 02:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415593, 951589, 86090, '<td valign="top">Beautiful find, very nice work!</td>', 'Beautiful find, very nice work!', '2011-05-17 03:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415624, 951036, 40391, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image that is well composed and from a great perspective.   Well done.</td>', 'A beautiful image that is well composed and from a great perspective.   Well done.', '2011-05-17 04:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415626, 951734, 40391, '<td valign="top">Such lovely colours captured in the flower but especially the bokeh.  Well done!</td>', 'Such lovely colours captured in the flower but especially the bokeh.  Well done!', '2011-05-17 04:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415629, 951645, 40391, '<td valign="top">One of the best presentations of a desert in sunset with a reflecting pond I feel I have seen on this site.  Truelly wonder  well done and good luck!</td>', 'One of the best presentations of a desert in sunset with a reflecting pond I feel I have seen on this site.  Truelly wonder  well done and good luck!', '2011-05-17 05:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415637, 951568, 40391, '<td valign="top">Her eyes are incredible but for me its her smile that makes the image.  It is difficult to be certain that this was taken with a low sun light but for me I believe that such wonderful lighting was captured during the golden hour.  Well done!</td>', 'Her eyes are incredible but for me its her smile that makes the image.  It is difficult to be certain that this was taken with a low sun light but for me I believe that such wonderful lighting was captured during the golden hour.  Well done!', '2011-05-17 05:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415640, 951722, 40391, '<td valign="top">There is no better way to show you have nailed the challenge than with a rainbow (a double at that) and a well lit ground and dark, menacing sky.  However, its hard to get past the lean to the left which is quite distracting.  The point I would have taken off for that is regained by the black bird that completes your image nicely.  Good luck.</td>', 'There is no better way to show you have nailed the challenge than with a rainbow (a double at that) and a well lit ground and dark, menacing sky.  However, its hard to get past the lean to the left which is quite distracting.  The point I would have taken off for that is regained by the black bird that completes your image nicely.  Good luck.', '2011-05-17 05:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415646, 951448, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful shot that nails the challenge.  Id love to be in a place with such grandeur, but then, Im not sure I would be overly keen to venture out when it appears so cold.  But then again, yes I would for a shot like this.  Well done!</td>', 'This is a really beautiful shot that nails the challenge.  Id love to be in a place with such grandeur, but then, Im not sure I would be overly keen to venture out when it appears so cold.  But then again, yes I would for a shot like this.  Well done!', '2011-05-17 05:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415650, 951413, 40391, '<td valign="top">For a split second I thought oh no, another missed focus shot.  That was until I saw that sky.  Wow!  That is fantastic and Im glad you decided to focus on that.  The gold on the sign is just an added bonus for one of the best dramatic sky shots Ive seen for a while  well since my own similar image a few months ago titled A photog''s dream of ''Nice Weather''.  Actually, I prefer yours.  Well done!</td>', 'For a split second I thought oh no, another missed focus shot.  That was until I saw that sky.  Wow!  That is fantastic and Im glad you decided to focus on that.  The gold on the sign is just an added bonus for one of the best dramatic sky shots Ive seen for a while  well since my own similar image a few months ago titled A photog''s dream of ''Nice Weather''.  Actually, I prefer yours.  Well done!', '2011-05-17 05:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415651, 951758, 40391, '<td valign="top">This definitely meets the challenge and I do like the fauna on the right and tint in the clouds.  However, compared to other entrys this seems to just miss.  The location is great and I do like the ducks when you look for them.  Good luck.</td>', 'This definitely meets the challenge and I do like the fauna on the right and tint in the clouds.  However, compared to other entrys this seems to just miss.  The location is great and I do like the ducks when you look for them.  Good luck.', '2011-05-17 05:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415653, 951767, 40391, '<td valign="top">A really beautiful image with wonderful colours.  I especially like the shallow DoF and soft focus.  But its the lighting that really makes this a pleasure to view.  Well done and good luck!</td>', 'A really beautiful image with wonderful colours.  I especially like the shallow DoF and soft focus.  But its the lighting that really makes this a pleasure to view.  Well done and good luck!', '2011-05-17 05:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415663, 951645, 132008, '<td valign="top">great shot, hope you do well with the votes</td>', 'great shot, hope you do well with the votes', '2011-05-17 06:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415690, 951722, 124190, '<td valign="top">................purrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrfect..........................where is this? looks like there might actually be a pot of gold at the end of those rainbows!!!!...........<br/> <br/>.</td>', '................purrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrfect..........................where is this? looks like there might actually be a pot of gold at the end of those rainbows!!!!........... .', '2011-05-17 08:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415691, 951494, 124190, '<td valign="top">......wait.....this is RIGHT up MY Alley!!!!.....cool</td>', '......wait.....this is RIGHT up MY Alley!!!!.....cool', '2011-05-17 08:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415844, 951589, 58634, '<td valign="top">I feel like the rooftop is too dark, but I still really like the feel of this picture.</td>', 'I feel like the rooftop is too dark, but I still really like the feel of this picture.', '2011-05-17 13:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415847, 951767, 58634, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just me, but there''s too much "softness" in this picture. I think the flowers in the front at the right hand side are very distracting.<br/>Other than that, the model looks beautiful and the light is gorgeous.</td>', 'Maybe it''s just me, but there''s too much "softness" in this picture. I think the flowers in the front at the right hand side are very distracting.Other than that, the model looks beautiful and the light is gorgeous.', '2011-05-17 13:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415849, 951477, 58634, '<td valign="top">Very bold. I love it.</td>', 'Very bold. I love it.', '2011-05-17 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415850, 951597, 58634, '<td valign="top">WOW! The colors and the clarity are incredible!</td>', 'WOW! The colors and the clarity are incredible!', '2011-05-17 13:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415853, 951065, 58634, '<td valign="top">What beautiful colors!</td>', 'What beautiful colors!', '2011-05-17 13:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415854, 951621, 124875, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t see any particular light which could be identified as sunset or sunrise.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t see any particular light which could be identified as sunset or sunrise.', '2011-05-17 13:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415855, 951403, 58634, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. :)<br/> <br/>Wish the mountain didn''t look as washed out as it does, though. Still a very pretty photograph.</td>', 'I love this picture. :) Wish the mountain didn''t look as washed out as it does, though. Still a very pretty photograph.', '2011-05-17 13:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415857, 951763, 58634, '<td valign="top">Love the colors on the bird. I think the background green really adds to the picture also.</td>', 'Love the colors on the bird. I think the background green really adds to the picture also.', '2011-05-17 13:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415858, 951770, 124875, '<td valign="top">I like it! The boat is a little blurred, or is it just a sensation?</td>', 'I like it! The boat is a little blurred, or is it just a sensation?', '2011-05-17 13:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415860, 951734, 124875, '<td valign="top">The photo is good; the bokeh is fantastic, but the light could be the light of any hour of the day...</td>', 'The photo is good; the bokeh is fantastic, but the light could be the light of any hour of the day...', '2011-05-17 13:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415861, 951770, 58634, '<td valign="top">Love the deep blue colors, excellent!</td>', 'Love the deep blue colors, excellent!', '2011-05-17 14:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415862, 951656, 58634, '<td valign="top">I LOVE all the detail in this picture!!</td>', 'I LOVE all the detail in this picture!!', '2011-05-17 14:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415864, 951413, 58634, '<td valign="top">There''s definitely a wow factor in this picture. I love the colors, the clouds, the subject, everything!</td>', 'There''s definitely a wow factor in this picture. I love the colors, the clouds, the subject, everything!', '2011-05-17 14:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415866, 951613, 58634, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful! Love it.</td>', 'Very beautiful! Love it.', '2011-05-17 14:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415871, 951722, 58634, '<td valign="top">I am absolutely in love with this picture! The green grass, the dark clouds, and the rainbow are impecable. I love how a little bird was caught mid-flight, also.. Good luck!</td>', 'I am absolutely in love with this picture! The green grass, the dark clouds, and the rainbow are impecable. I love how a little bird was caught mid-flight, also.. Good luck!', '2011-05-17 14:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415872, 951491, 58634, '<td valign="top">Beautiul, warm tones. I like this. :)</td>', 'Beautiul, warm tones. I like this. :)', '2011-05-17 14:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415873, 951587, 58634, '<td valign="top">The clarity in this picture is outstanding.</td>', 'The clarity in this picture is outstanding.', '2011-05-17 14:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415874, 951641, 58634, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2011-05-17 14:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415875, 951505, 58634, '<td valign="top">Everything about this picture is beautiful!</td>', 'Everything about this picture is beautiful!', '2011-05-17 14:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415876, 951719, 58634, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling this might be a ribbon..</td>', 'I have a feeling this might be a ribbon..', '2011-05-17 14:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415885, 951633, 10785, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene... love the V composition created by the reflection. It looks a little dark but the golden color of the fields looks great.</td>', 'Beautiful scene... love the V composition created by the reflection. It looks a little dark but the golden color of the fields looks great.', '2011-05-17 14:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415890, 951106, 10785, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2011-05-17 14:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415894, 951630, 10785, '<td valign="top">She just had to put her hand on the statue''s boob, right??</td>', 'She just had to put her hand on the statue''s boob, right??', '2011-05-17 14:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415902, 951166, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very serene pastoral scene. Great light. The photo itself is a little red and there is not a lot of contrast. Perhaps a curves adjustment to fix that. I think the composition suffers from not following the rule of thirds. I would suggest re-framing to get the pine trees out of the scene in the bottom right and placing the barn in the bottom right third. Also re-frame to get rid of the brown line across the bottom of the shot and get the tree line into the top third (It is above the top third now.)</td>', 'Very serene pastoral scene. Great light. The photo itself is a little red and there is not a lot of contrast. Perhaps a curves adjustment to fix that. I think the composition suffers from not following the rule of thirds. I would suggest re-framing to get the pine trees out of the scene in the bottom right and placing the barn in the bottom right third. Also re-frame to get rid of the brown line across the bottom of the shot and get the tree line into the top third (It is above the top third now.)', '2011-05-17 14:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6415904, 951269, 10785, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the grass should be in front of her face... You could have poked a hole in the grass by pulling a few.</td>', 'I don''t think the grass should be in front of her face... You could have poked a hole in the grass by pulling a few.', '2011-05-17 14:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6416031, 951719, 130694, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites.. great capture (9)</td>', 'One of my favorites.. great capture (9)', '2011-05-17 18:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6416032, 951494, 130694, '<td valign="top">So creative.. love the shot!</td>', 'So creative.. love the shot!', '2011-05-17 18:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
