(6420352, 951452, 132021, '<td valign="top">I really like the framing in this shot and the green colors of the houses really compliment the sky. I always look for photographer in the shadows though, Busted!! :D</td>', 'I really like the framing in this shot and the green colors of the houses really compliment the sky. I always look for photographer in the shadows though, Busted!! :D', '2011-05-21 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6420355, 951750, 132021, '<td valign="top">At first I was thinking the door frame was distracting, but the more I look the more I like it. It adds depth to the scene. The composition is very well done as well, many "sunglass" shots simpley go verticle or full frame the face, but here it tells more story. I like it!</td>', 'At first I was thinking the door frame was distracting, but the more I look the more I like it. It adds depth to the scene. The composition is very well done as well, many "sunglass" shots simpley go verticle or full frame the face, but here it tells more story. I like it!', '2011-05-21 10:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6420358, 951276, 132021, '<td valign="top">An incredible capture, that''s for sure, really beutiful. My only concern is the sun is only to the left of the frame, versus behind you. Worth sharing and being proud of regardless of the rules though! :D</td>', 'An incredible capture, that''s for sure, really beutiful. My only concern is the sun is only to the left of the frame, versus behind you. Worth sharing and being proud of regardless of the rules though! :D', '2011-05-21 10:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6420359, 951568, 132021, '<td valign="top">The texture of his hair, the soft bakeh are really nice. It seems about a micrometer from absolute tack-sharp though, which is really what takes these to the next level for me.</td>', 'The texture of his hair, the soft bakeh are really nice. It seems about a micrometer from absolute tack-sharp though, which is really what takes these to the next level for me.', '2011-05-21 10:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6420361, 951407, 132021, '<td valign="top">While I love the texturing and the lighting in this, I''m a bit confused by the area at the far right of the image. I''ll be interested to see the photographer''s comments on what this is.</td>', 'While I love the texturing and the lighting in this, I''m a bit confused by the area at the far right of the image. I''ll be interested to see the photographer''s comments on what this is.', '2011-05-21 10:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6420364, 951370, 132021, '<td valign="top">I REALLY like the idea of this photograph, but I''m lost in the story. Sorrow, sadness, a cane, a fence, a sign that says to call the "maritans", which reads "martians" to me. Perhaps the story is that simple, when I desire to feel more. The grain effect works perfect though and the composition is really nice. The long shadows of days end really add to this.</td>', 'I REALLY like the idea of this photograph, but I''m lost in the story. Sorrow, sadness, a cane, a fence, a sign that says to call the "maritans", which reads "martians" to me. Perhaps the story is that simple, when I desire to feel more. The grain effect works perfect though and the composition is really nice. The long shadows of days end really add to this.', '2011-05-21 10:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6420365, 951413, 132021, '<td valign="top">You''ll always get extra credit points from me when veteran''s are a subject :) This is a great shot, and I really like howt he clouds seem to swirl around the memorial!</td>', 'You''ll always get extra credit points from me when veteran''s are a subject :) This is a great shot, and I really like howt he clouds seem to swirl around the memorial!', '2011-05-21 10:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
