(6421392, 951802, 120171, '<td valign="top">A good shot but for me the blown out sky does not fit the challenge, had the Crane had some sunset/sunrise lighting caught on its feathers it would have been a great shot.</td>', 'A good shot but for me the blown out sky does not fit the challenge, had the Crane had some sunset/sunrise lighting caught on its feathers it would have been a great shot.', '2011-05-22 14:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
