(6421791, 951448, 39057, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo of the sunrise. The fog is nice too. I held some paper up to the bottom of the photo to cover the foreground up to the fog. It may have been better if it was cropped to the fog. However, I''m not a landscape photographer so don''t be bothered by my 2 cents !<br/> <br/> I can''t give it my highest score because there is one or two other landscapes that may very will win the blue. I have to reserve my highest score for that one. I''d say top 15 for this one.</td>', 'This is a good photo of the sunrise. The fog is nice too. I held some paper up to the bottom of the photo to cover the foreground up to the fog. It may have been better if it was cropped to the fog. However, I''m not a landscape photographer so don''t be bothered by my 2 cents !  I can''t give it my highest score because there is one or two other landscapes that may very will win the blue. I have to reserve my highest score for that one. I''d say top 15 for this one.', '2011-05-22 23:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421802, 951656, 39057, '<td valign="top">First off, the reflection doesn''t do it for me. When I see a photo with a reflection, I want to see the whole top of the image in the reflection....not just the top part of the photo. The yellow "sunlit" areas also look fake.  The water is too clear too. I know everything there is to know about photography so all I can give this is a nine. Lol !<br/> <br/>Back for another look. This is one of the best landscapes. There are one or two better but this could be top 5.</td>', 'First off, the reflection doesn''t do it for me. When I see a photo with a reflection, I want to see the whole top of the image in the reflection....not just the top part of the photo. The yellow "sunlit" areas also look fake.  The water is too clear too. I know everything there is to know about photography so all I can give this is a nine. Lol ! Back for another look. This is one of the best landscapes. There are one or two better but this could be top 5.', '2011-05-22 23:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
