(6421816, 951597, 39057, '<td valign="top">I have to say...this is the clearest photo I''ve ever seen.  Looks a little bright to be sunset but will not take points away.<br/> <br/>Taking another look.... Looks like the sun is behind and to the left of the leftmost peak but I can''t be sure. If the "DPC Challenge Description Police" don''t pull this down, it should ribbon easy ! Moving up to a 10.<br/> <br/>Ok...this is my top score. There is a cityscape that may beat this out for the Blue but it should be close !<br/> <br/>Good luck !</td>', 'I have to say...this is the clearest photo I''ve ever seen.  Looks a little bright to be sunset but will not take points away. Taking another look.... Looks like the sun is behind and to the left of the leftmost peak but I can''t be sure. If the "DPC Challenge Description Police" don''t pull this down, it should ribbon easy ! Moving up to a 10. Ok...this is my top score. There is a cityscape that may beat this out for the Blue but it should be close ! Good luck !', '2011-05-23 00:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
