(6422086, 951558, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Margaret. I love that golden, hazy light. You did well to catch it because it was a crummy week for sunsets/sunrises, wasn''t it?</td>', 'Congratulations Margaret. I love that golden, hazy light. You did well to catch it because it was a crummy week for sunsets/sunrises, wasn''t it?', '2011-05-23 04:34:20.000000', NULL, 0),
