(6422089, 951558, 113156, '<td valign="top">A stunning shot, congrats on the red and the awesome score.</td>', 'A stunning shot, congrats on the red and the awesome score.', '2011-05-23 04:36:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6422090, 951767, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very nice, Kris. The lighting on her face is very appealing, with the golden light on her hair and shadowed eyes, but still keeping excellent detail. The dark space behind her head also helps this effect immensely.<br/>Only thing, for me, is the flowers right front- they do seem a bit obtrusive. Very nice, in any case though.</td>', 'Very nice, Kris. The lighting on her face is very appealing, with the golden light on her hair and shadowed eyes, but still keeping excellent detail. The dark space behind her head also helps this effect immensely.Only thing, for me, is the flowers right front- they do seem a bit obtrusive. Very nice, in any case though.', '2011-05-23 04:38:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6422094, 951768, 28742, '<td valign="top">Oh jeez - I could post my thoughts about light, solar characteristics, the curvature of the earth and how all that makes me doubt that she is heading west or I could ask you for the long form GPS report with actual satellite photo to prove that she is actually heading west, OR I could say "Great photo, Leo! Congrats on the excellent score and the near-top ten finish!" Hmmm, decisions decisions...</td>', 'Oh jeez - I could post my thoughts about light, solar characteristics, the curvature of the earth and how all that makes me doubt that she is heading west or I could ask you for the long form GPS report with actual satellite photo to prove that she is actually heading west, OR I could say "Great photo, Leo! Congrats on the excellent score and the near-top ten finish!" Hmmm, decisions decisions...', '2011-05-23 04:54:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6422099, 951768, 54033, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh jeez - I could post my thoughts about light, solar characteristics, the curvature of the earth and how all that makes me doubt that she is heading west or I could ask you for the long form GPS report with actual satellite photo to prove that she is actually heading west, OR I could say "Great photo, Leo! Congrats on the excellent score and the near-top ten finish!" Hmmm, decisions decisions... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>See; I recently joined the Coffee Arabic party, a group that copied the Tea Party ideals, and for my initiation I have to come up with some really silly doubts to prove worthy to join the chapter of the Tea Party/Coffee Arabica.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-05-23 04:21:28.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Oh jeez - I could post my thoughts about light, solar characteristics, the curvature of the earth and how all that makes me doubt that she is heading west or I could ask you for the long form GPS report with actual satellite photo to prove that she is actually heading west, OR I could say "Great photo, Leo! Congrats on the excellent score and the near-top ten finish!" Hmmm, decisions decisions...   See; I recently joined the Coffee Arabic party, a group that copied the Tea Party ideals, and for my initiation I have to come up with some really silly doubts to prove worthy to join the chapter of the Tea Party/Coffee Arabica.', '2011-05-23 05:04:53.000000', '2011-05-23 05:21:28.000000', 0),
(6422104, 951711, 132177, '<td valign="top">Did I say that I deserve a ribbon? No, at all because many others are much better. I think i was clear that many photos are not related to the subject.</td>', 'Did I say that I deserve a ribbon? No, at all because many others are much better. I think i was clear that many photos are not related to the subject.', '2011-05-23 05:13:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6422109, 951719, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. Top notch and well deserving of the blue and super high score. Congrats.</td>', 'Wonderful image. Top notch and well deserving of the blue and super high score. Congrats.', '2011-05-23 05:43:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6422114, 951711, 67152, '<td valign="top">You don''t need to have a sunset in the picture using a reflection.  The challenge was to take a photo during sunrise or sunset but face away and see the good light that the sunrise or sunset brings to a subject.  All the top 10 images fit the challenge perfectly, and I am sure most of the others did as well.</td>', 'You don''t need to have a sunset in the picture using a reflection.  The challenge was to take a photo during sunrise or sunset but face away and see the good light that the sunrise or sunset brings to a subject.  All the top 10 images fit the challenge perfectly, and I am sure most of the others did as well.', '2011-05-23 06:32:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6422115, 951656, 86218, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the HM for this image Philip. As ever - great work<b></b></td>', 'Congrats on the HM for this image Philip. As ever - great work', '2011-05-23 06:32:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6422118, 951352, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful stuff. I actually think the fisherdude adds to the environment. Congrats!</td>', 'Beautiful stuff. I actually think the fisherdude adds to the environment. Congrats!', '2011-05-23 06:46:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6422120, 951641, 54033, '<td valign="top">WOW Great Shot! It has been a while.<br/></td>', 'WOW Great Shot! It has been a while.', '2011-05-23 07:03:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6422121, 951767, 28742, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, Kris! Congrats on your new personal best!</td>', 'Beautiful image, Kris! Congrats on your new personal best!', '2011-05-23 07:05:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6422123, 951768, 108069, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry I misjudged you, Leo. I gave this a 1 because I was certain she was not walking west. Titles are very important to me, you see.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the great finish. Great shot.</td>', 'I''m sorry I misjudged you, Leo. I gave this a 1 because I was certain she was not walking west. Titles are very important to me, you see. Congrats on the great finish. Great shot.', '2011-05-23 07:19:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6422125, 951558, 59029, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a fantastic shot.  Huge congrats on a second ribbon in so little time, Margaret! :-)</td>', 'Wow, what a fantastic shot.  Huge congrats on a second ribbon in so little time, Margaret! :-)', '2011-05-23 07:30:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6422127, 951768, 67152, '<td valign="top">The insane thing is that people could not see that the woman was looking into the sun (therefore you must have been looking away from the sun).  <br/> <br/>The light is low...check<br/>The shadows are heading towards the model...check<br/>The sun is in her face...check<br/> <br/>It must not meet challenge because there is a shadow on her face...DNMC!!!!!<br/> <br/>I am about ready to lose it for the incredibly stupid and narrow interpretations that some folks have while voting.<br/> <br/>This is a really nice shot, worth a 7 during voting from me.</td>', 'The insane thing is that people could not see that the woman was looking into the sun (therefore you must have been looking away from the sun).   The light is low...checkThe shadows are heading towards the model...checkThe sun is in her face...check It must not meet challenge because there is a shadow on her face...DNMC!!!!! I am about ready to lose it for the incredibly stupid and narrow interpretations that some folks have while voting. This is a really nice shot, worth a 7 during voting from me.', '2011-05-23 07:33:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6422158, 951734, 11854, '<td valign="top">I never did get a chance to vote on this challenge. This is beautifully done! Gorgeous colors and bokeh! And I thank you for the lovely comment you left me.</td>', 'I never did get a chance to vote on this challenge. This is beautifully done! Gorgeous colors and bokeh! And I thank you for the lovely comment you left me.', '2011-05-23 08:46:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6422170, 951656, 114233, '<td valign="top">Very nice Philip and deserving of a good high finish. Tricky - a polarised filter might have helped the sky a bit - but then I''m guessing the reflection would have vanished. Still very good though!</td>', 'Very nice Philip and deserving of a good high finish. Tricky - a polarised filter might have helped the sky a bit - but then I''m guessing the reflection would have vanished. Still very good though!', '2011-05-23 08:53:07.000000', NULL, 0),
